# DJI Thermal SDK compiled binaries. Per lib/License.txt, only the headers
# (tsdk-core/api/) are MIT-licensed; libdirp and everything under
# tsdk-core/lib/ and utility/bin/ are covered by DJI's separate SDK EULA
# (https://developer.dji.com/policies/eula/), which prohibits redistributing
# the object code under an open source license. Download the SDK yourself
# from https://www.dji.com/downloads/softwares/dji-thermal-sdk and place it
# under lib/ -- see README.md.
/lib/tsdk-core/lib/
/lib/utility/
